A||||5||Bazooka||Cleaning K&N Filters||||1||
Z||000000||Bazooka||11-03-2001||03:28 PM||||Does anyone know the right way to clean and oil the K&N Cone Style Air Filters. Also, what cleaners to use when doing this. <BR>TIA<BR>********************************** ||||reg||1
Z||000001||California Kid||11-03-2001||03:38 PM||||Unless someone else knows some proven tricks, use only the K&N Recharger Kit to clean and recondition the filter. Most speed shop carry it or you can get it quickly through Summit Racing mail order.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Signature_7.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Mach10||11-03-2001||04:09 PM||||dishwasher!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||10
Z||000003||Svyn||11-03-2001||07:17 PM||||Buy the recharger kit, it has everything you need (minus a sink and dust-pan brush). Bang it out real good ( carefull), clean it wish a brush, spray the "filter cleaner" on it, let sit 10 mins, wash out ( from inside out ) with hose light water pressure. Let sit 30 mins to dry. Spray with enclosed filter oil, volia. S'what I do, it has the insturctions on the kit.<P>------------------<BR>-Dale Clark<BR>86' Fiero SE<BR>99' Dodge Durango SLT+<BR>92' Ford ThunderBird SuperCoupe||||reg||1
Z||000004||JohnF||11-03-2001||07:34 PM||||"Dishwasher" is the right answer!  After filter is clean, use K & N renewal procedures.||||reg||10
Z||000005||Old Lar||11-03-2001||08:29 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Svyn:<BR><B>wash out ( from inside out ) with hose light water pressure. Let sit 30 mins to dry. Spray with enclosed filter oil, volia. S'what I do, it has the insturctions on the kit.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>On the V6 K&N filter the air comes into the center of the filter and the filtered air goes out to the throttle body..  By washing from the inside out, you drive the dirt into the filter.  Better to rinse the dirt from the outside in to flush the dirt from the collection surface, the center of the filter.||||reg||1
